  "about": "Google's QAT Q4_0 Gemma 4 12B fully on one 8 GB laptop card with ggml-org's MTP head drafting 2 tokens and an 81,920-token q4_0 KV cache. The mmproj runs on the CPU (--no-mmproj-offload), which keeps vision and frees about 340 MiB of VRAM; ubatch 128 and a q4_0 draft KV cache make 80K fit. In 30 s runs of the lab's speed prompt on an RTX A2000 8GB Laptop GPU at 35 W (llama.cpp b11146, q4_0 KV): no draft 20.6; MTP 1 / 2 / 3 at 48K 30.2 / 31.3-32.2 / 30.5; MTP 4 at 32K 30.2; a Q8_0 draft head 26.0; MTP 2 at 64K (ubatch 256) 32.3, 72K 31.7, 80K 31.4 tok/s at 7,865 MiB with 519 tok/s prefill. 96K fails to create the MTP context. Generation and thinking are uncapped.",
